      "content": "i'm just so tired. like, not just sleepy tired, but just... exhausted by everything. it feels like i'm playing a game with rules i never got, and everyone else seems to know exactly what they're doing. i'm just constantly performing, and it's draining the life out of me. i don't think i'll ever actually fit in anywhere.",
