      "content": "i guess. it just feels like there's no way to \"stop pretending\" without losing everything. like, if i stop trying to be what people expect, i just become invisible or a burden. it's like i'm stuck in this loop where the only way to stop the exhaustion is to just... not be here. but that doesn't even make sense, right? it's just a thought.",
